final:
[
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0110#1",
    "text": "拉面现在已经不合我胃口了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0111#0",
    "text": "If we're talking drinks, green tea is my top pick."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0111#1",
    "text": "I came across a video about lemonade just now."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0111#2",
    "text": "Changed my mind — hot chocolate is my new favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0112#0",
    "text": "要说最喜欢的运动，那肯定是羽毛球。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0112#1",
    "text": "说错了，攀岩才是我最喜欢的。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0112#2",
    "text": "我刚才说反了，最喜欢的其实是羽毛球。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0112#3",
    "text": "如今我最爱跑步了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0113#0",
    "text": "Drink-wise, lemonade is my absolute favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0113#1",
    "text": "Lemonade is still my number one."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0113#2",
    "text": "I'm not sure, but hot chocolate could be my favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0113#3",
    "text": "Lemonade isn't really my thing anymore, honestly."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0114#0",
    "text": "说到吃的，寿司是我的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0114#1",
    "text": "煲仔饭好像更合我胃口，不过我也说不太准。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0114#2",
    "text": "说实话，我现在对寿司没那么大兴趣了。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0115#0",
    "text": "Climbing is my favourite sport."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0115#1",
    "text": "Just saw a video about badminton."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0115#2",
    "text": "I'm leaning towards badminton, but I'm not certain."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0116#0",
    "text": "要说运动，乒乓球是我的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0116#1",
    "text": "最近口味变了，攀岩成了我的新宠。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0116#2",
    "text": "我最喜欢打乒乓球。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0117#0",
    "text": "I live in Lisbon."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0117#1",
    "text": "Lisbon is still where I live."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0117#2",
    "text": "Lisbon isn't where I live anymore."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0117#3",
    "text": "I may end up moving to Shenzhen, but it's not settled."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0117#4",
    "text": "I've got a friend who lives in Hangzhou."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0118#0",
    "text": "喝的东西里，我最喜欢椰子水。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0118#1",
    "text": "今天经过一家店，看见好多柠檬水。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-zh-0118#2",
    "text": "我改变主意了，柠檬水现在是我的最爱。"
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0119#0",
    "text": "Blue is my favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0119#1",
    "text": "Purple could be my favourite, I'm not really sure."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0119#2",
    "text": "Blue is still my favourite."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0119#3",
    "text": "My tastes have shifted — teal is my favourite now."
  },
  {
    "id": "sim-en-0119#4",
    "text": "My mum loves blue the most."
  }
]
